msgid ""
"For plane, the main loop frequency default is 50 hz.  This is too low for "
"most system ID applications. The minimum log sampling frequency should be "
"100hz.  The easiest way to achieve this is to set "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` to 100 hz and set the "
":ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` parameter for a rate divider of 1 using the "
"table below."
msgstr ""
"对于固定翼（Plane），主循环频率默认为 50 hz，这对大多数系统辨识应用来说太低了。日志采样频率最低应为 100hz。最简单的方法是将 "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 设置为 100 hz，并按下表将 "
":ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 参数的速率分频器设置为 1。"
